# Generated from tools/data/rulebooks/tysiac.json; run tools/compile-rulebooks.rb.
module GameRoomGames
  class Tysiac
    module GeneratedRulebook
      private

      def generated_rule_sections
        [
          rule_section(:auction, GameRoomRules.translate("Win the auction, then fulfil your promise"),
            GameRoomRules.translate("The 1000 card game can be played by two or three people individually, by four with one person sitting out each deal, or by two teams of two. Choose the variant when creating the table; three individual players is the default. The deck has 24 cards: nine, jack, queen, king, ten and ace in every suit. Players bid for the right to take a talon. The winning bidder promises to collect at least the contracted number of points during the deal."),
            GameRoomRules.translate("The player after the dealer opens at no less than 100. Later bids rise in steps of five. Passing removes you from this auction, not from the game. You may bid up to 120 plus the values of the marriages you currently hold, with an overall maximum of 400. A marriage is a king and queen of the same suit."),
            GameRoomRules.translate("With three players, each receives seven cards and the three remaining cards form one talon. The auction winner takes those three revealed cards, then gives one card to each opponent in the announced order. Each recipient learns only their own card. Everyone then has eight cards, to be played in eight tricks."),
            GameRoomRules.translate("Once the cards have been given away or set aside, the bidder can raise the final contract within the limit allowed by the marriages still held. Playing the first card accepts the current contract, so a second bid is not compulsory.")),
          rule_section(:two_players, GameRoomRules.translate("Two players: choose one of two talons"),
            GameRoomRules.translate("The two-player variant uses two separate, face-down talons. Choose two or three cards in each talon in the table settings. With two-card talons, each player is dealt ten cards. With three-card talons, each receives nine. Three cards is the default. The auction works as described above."),
            GameRoomRules.translate("The auction winner chooses the first or second talon without seeing either one's contents. Only the chosen talon is then revealed and added to the winner's hand. The other remains face down. The bidder now sets aside as many cards as were taken, one at a time, using Enter on a card. These discards are not shown to the opponent, and no card is passed to them. The players finish with ten cards each for two-card talons, or nine each for three-card talons."),
            GameRoomRules.translate("The checkbox Set-aside cards go to the last trick winner is enabled by default. It awards the card points from both the unchosen talon and the bidder's discards to whoever takes the last trick, before checking the contract. Thus all 120 card points remain in play. It does not award marriages from those cards or add the cards to the winner's hand. If the checkbox is disabled, nobody scores those cards, so fewer than 120 card points may be available in tricks."),
            GameRoomRules.translate("For example, suppose the unchosen talon contains an ace and a nine, and the bidder sets aside a king and a jack. Those four cards are worth 17 points. With the checkbox enabled, winning the last trick gives its winner these 17 points in addition to the points in the trick itself. With it disabled, those 17 points are not awarded.")),
          rule_section(:four_players, GameRoomRules.translate("Four players: a rotating rest or two teams"),
            GameRoomRules.translate("In the individual four-player variant, the dealer sits out. The other three play exactly as in the three-player variant: seven cards each, a three-card talon, then eight tricks. The rest moves to the next person each deal. The resting player keeps their score, does not bid or play, and does not use a barrel chance or collect a zero for that deal."),
            GameRoomRules.translate("In the team variant, first choose two pairs at the table. Partners sit alternately, and all four play every deal. Each receives five cards; four more form the talon. The auction winner takes the talon and gives one card to each other player, including their partner. Everyone then has six cards for six tricks. You see only your own hand. You may outbid your partner, but your bidding limit still depends only on marriages in your own hand."),
            GameRoomRules.translate("A pair has one shared score. Add both partners' trick points and declared marriages before checking the contract. A fulfilled contract of 150 earns the pair 150, even if they collected 170; collecting only 140 loses 150. The other pair adds its combined points, rounded once to five. Barrel chances, zeroes and surrenders also belong to the pair. A marriage must be held by one player: a king in your hand and a queen in your partner's hand do not form one."),
            GameRoomRules.translate("The winning bidder may surrender after seeing the talon and before passing the first card, unless their team is on the barrel. The opposing pair receives half the contract, at least 60, rounded upwards to five, only once for the pair. Every third surrender by either partner costs their team 120; there is no additional failed-contract penalty or zero. An opposing team on the barrel gets no surrender award and does not lose a barrel chance.")),
          rule_section(:tricks, GameRoomRules.translate("Taking tricks and declaring marriages"),
            GameRoomRules.translate("The bidder leads the first trick. Everyone taking part in the deal plays one card, and the trick's winner leads next. A trick contains two cards with two players, three in the individual three- or four-player variants, or four in teams. You must follow the first card's suit if possible. If you have none of that suit, you must use a trump if a trump suit has been established and you hold one. Only otherwise may you discard any card. You do not have to beat a higher card merely because you can. These rules also apply when your partner is winning the trick."),
            GameRoomRules.translate("The order from strongest to weakest is ace, ten, king, queen, jack, nine. A trump beats every non-trump. With no trump in the trick, the highest card of the led suit wins. At the beginning of the deal there is no trump suit."),
            GameRoomRules.translate("After the first trick, a player leading a trick may declare a marriage by playing its king or queen while still holding the matching partner. The declared suit becomes trump immediately. Hearts add 100 points, diamonds 80, clubs 60 and spades 40. A later marriage changes trump again. Simply owning the pair, or playing it without the declaration, does not award that bonus.")),
          rule_section(:points, GameRoomRules.translate("Points in cards are not the same as the score you receive"),
            GameRoomRules.translate("An ace is worth 11, a ten 10, a king four, a queen three, a jack two and a nine zero. The cards total 120 points. Add any declared marriages before checking the bidder's contract."),
            GameRoomRules.translate("A successful bidder receives exactly the contract value, not all the points collected. A failed bidder loses the contract value. Defenders add their collected points rounded to the nearest five. The bidder's success is checked before rounding: 118 points do not fulfil a contract of 120."),
            GameRoomRules.translate("The target is normally 1000. You can choose another multiple of five, at least 200. Reaching the target ends the game, subject to the barrel rules below. In teams the target applies to the pair's shared score.")),
          rule_section(:barrel, GameRoomRules.translate("Near the target: the barrel"),
            GameRoomRules.translate("When your score reaches the interval from 120 below the target to just below the target, it is set to exactly 120 below and you go onto the barrel. At the usual target this means 880. Defender points no longer increase your score there. You have three deals to win and fulfil a contract of at least 120."),
            GameRoomRules.translate("Failing a contract on the barrel subtracts its normal value and takes you off. Using up all three chances without success costs 120 and also takes you off. If someone else takes the talon and surrenders before play, that deal does not use one of your chances. You cannot surrender your own contract while on the barrel. A different target moves the barrel threshold with it."),
            GameRoomRules.translate("The game announces when someone goes onto the barrel and records it in the history. S reads scores and marks the players currently on the barrel. Shift+S also tells you how many barrel chances they have left.")),
          rule_section(:penalties, GameRoomRules.translate("Surrendering and collecting no points"),
            GameRoomRules.translate("After seeing the talon but before giving away or setting aside the first card, the bidder may surrender, unless on the barrel. Each defender receives at least 60, or half the contract if that is higher, rounded upwards to five. With two players there is only one defender, receiving the same award. No last-trick award applies to a surrendered deal. The bidder normally receives zero. Every third surrender additionally costs the bidder 120 points."),
            GameRoomRules.translate("Collecting exactly zero unrounded points in three played deals costs 120. A small result that merely rounds to zero does not count as a zero deal. These zeroes are not accumulated while you are on the barrel.")),
          rule_section(:controls, GameRoomRules.translate("Game keyboard shortcuts"),
            GameRoomRules.translate("Arrows: choose a bid, talon card or trick card."),
            GameRoomRules.translate("Enter: confirm the current choice; on a card, play or choose a marriage."),
            GameRoomRules.translate("Shift+Enter: declare a legal marriage directly; without one, do not play."),
            GameRoomRules.translate("B: change the final contract before playing the first card."),
            GameRoomRules.translate("H: read your hand."),
            GameRoomRules.translate("C: read the trick cards."),
            GameRoomRules.translate("Ctrl+C: browse the trick cards."),
            GameRoomRules.translate("F: read the trump suit."),
            GameRoomRules.translate("Shift+S: read zeroes, surrenders and barrel chances."),
            GameRoomRules.translate("Z: next legal trick card; a possible marriage prevents automatic play."),
            GameRoomRules.translate("Shift+Z: previous legal trick card; a possible marriage prevents automatic play."),
            GameRoomRules.translate("S: read scores."),
            GameRoomRules.translate("T: read whose turn it is."),
            GameRoomRules.translate("Shift+C: sort by suit or colour; press again to reverse the order."),
            GameRoomRules.translate("Shift+H: sort by rank or value; press again to reverse the order."),
            GameRoomRules.translate("Shift+M: restore the order in which cards were received."))
        ]
      end

      def localized_rule_sections
        case GameRoomLocalization.primary_language
        when "cs"
          [
            rule_section(:aim, "C\u00EDl hry",
              "V Tis\u00EDci z\u00EDsk\u00E1v\u00E1\u0161 body za sebran\u00E9 karty a ohl\u00E1\u0161en\u00E9 dvojice kr\u00E1le s d\u00E1mou. Po rozd\u00E1n\u00ED licitujete, kdo se zav\u00E1\u017Ee z\u00EDskat nejv\u00EDce bod\u016F. V\u00EDt\u011Bz licitace mus\u00ED slib splnit, ostatn\u00ED se mu v tom sna\u017E\u00ED zabr\u00E1nit a sami bodovat. Vyhr\u00E1v\u00E1 dosa\u017Een\u00ED 1000 bod\u016F.",
              "Z\u00E1kladn\u00ED hra je pro t\u0159i hr\u00E1\u010De. Ka\u017Ed\u00FD dostane sedm karet a v\u00EDt\u011Bz licitace p\u0159ibere t\u0159i z tal\u00F3nu. Hraje se kartami od dev\u00EDtky po eso."),
            rule_section(:cards, "S\u00EDla karet a jejich body",
              "Po licitaci ka\u017Ed\u00FD postupn\u011B zahraje jednu kartu. Trojice vytvo\u0159\u00ED zdvih, kter\u00FD z\u00EDsk\u00E1 jeden hr\u00E1\u010D i s bodovou hodnotou t\u011Bchto karet.",
              "Nejsiln\u011Bj\u0161\u00ED je eso, potom des\u00EDtka, kr\u00E1l, d\u00E1ma, kluk a dev\u00EDtka. Za sebran\u00E9 karty dostane\u0161:",
              "- Eso: 11 bod\u016F.",
              "- Des\u00EDtka: 10 bod\u016F.",
              "- Kr\u00E1l: 4 body.",
              "- D\u00E1ma: 3 body.",
              "- Kluk: 2 body.",
              "- Dev\u00EDtka: \u017E\u00E1dn\u00FD bod.",
              "V bal\u00ED\u010Dku je celkem 120 bod\u016F. Dal\u0161\u00ED p\u0159in\u00E1\u0161\u00ED hl\u00E1\u0161ka, tedy ozn\u00E1men\u00E1 dvojice kr\u00E1le a d\u00E1my stejn\u00E9 barvy. Jak ji ozn\u00E1mit, vysv\u011Btluje kapitola Hl\u00E1\u0161ky."),
            rule_section(:auction, "Licitace",
              "Ruku si prohl\u00E9dni \u0161ipkami nebo p\u0159e\u010Dti kl\u00E1vesou H. Za\u010D\u00EDn\u00E1 hr\u00E1\u010D po rozd\u00E1vaj\u00EDc\u00EDm. Prvn\u00ED nab\u00EDdka je nejm\u00E9n\u011B 100, dal\u0161\u00ED ji mus\u00ED zv\u00FD\u0161it alespo\u0148 o 5. Nab\u00EDz\u00ED se jen n\u00E1sobky p\u011Bti.",
              "Na tahu stiskni Enter na libovoln\u00E9 kart\u011B. V nab\u00EDdce zvol \u0161ipkami bodov\u00FD z\u00E1vazek nebo odstoupen\u00ED a potvr\u010F Enterem. Kdo odstoup\u00ED, do t\u00E9to licitace se u\u017E nevr\u00E1t\u00ED. Za\u010D\u00EDnaj\u00EDc\u00ED hr\u00E1\u010D nejprve mus\u00ED n\u011Bco nab\u00EDdnout.",
              "Bez hl\u00E1\u0161ky v ruce lze nab\u00EDdnout nejv\u00FD\u0161 120. Ka\u017Ed\u00E1 dr\u017Een\u00E1 hl\u00E1\u0161ka zvy\u0161uje tento strop o svou hodnotu, nikdy v\u0161ak nad 400. Seznam nab\u00EDz\u00ED jen z\u00E1vazky p\u0159\u00EDpustn\u00E9 pro tv\u00E9 karty.",
              "Jakmile odstoup\u00ED v\u0161ichni krom\u011B jednoho, jeho posledn\u00ED nab\u00EDdka se stane z\u00E1vazkem pro toto rozd\u00E1n\u00ED. Sou\u010Dasn\u00E9 nab\u00EDdky p\u0159e\u010Dte B."),
            rule_section(:talon, "Tal\u00F3n a kone\u010Dn\u00FD z\u00E1vazek",
              "V\u00EDt\u011Bz licitace dostane tal\u00F3n a jeho obsah usly\u0161\u00ED v\u0161ichni. Pak p\u0159ed\u00E1 ka\u017Ed\u00E9mu soupe\u0159i jednu kartu. Vyber \u0161ipkami kartu pro ozn\u00E1men\u00E9ho hr\u00E1\u010De a potvr\u010F Enterem, potom tot\u00E9\u017E ud\u011Blej pro druh\u00E9ho. Ka\u017Ed\u00FD bude m\u00EDt osm karet.",
              "Potom sm\u00ED\u0161 z\u00E1vazek ponechat nebo zv\u00FD\u0161it. Stiskni B, \u0161ipkami zvol hodnotu a potvr\u010F Enterem. Nov\u00FD strop ur\u010Duj\u00ED hl\u00E1\u0161ky, kter\u00E9 ti zbyly, d\u0159\u00EDv\u011Bj\u0161\u00ED slib ale sn\u00ED\u017Eit nesm\u00ED\u0161.",
              "V\u00EDt\u011Bz licitace tak\u00E9 prvn\u00ED vyn\u00E1\u0161\u00ED. Nechce\u0161-li z\u00E1vazek m\u011Bnit, prost\u011B vyber kartu \u0161ipkami a zahraj Enterem. Prvn\u00ED zahran\u00E1 karta mo\u017Enost zv\u00FD\u0161en\u00ED definitivn\u011B uzav\u0159e."),
            rule_section(:play, "Hran\u00ED zdvih\u016F",
              "Kartu vyb\u00EDr\u00E1\u0161 \u0161ipkami a hraje\u0161 Enterem. Do rozehran\u00E9ho zdvihu mus\u00ED\u0161 p\u0159iznat prvn\u00ED vynesenou barvu, m\u00E1\u0161-li ji. Po k\u00E1ru tedy zahraje\u0161 k\u00E1ro. Vy\u0161\u0161\u00ED soupe\u0159ovu kartu p\u0159eb\u00EDjet nemus\u00ED\u0161.",
              "Nem\u00E1\u0161-li vynesenou barvu, mus\u00ED\u0161 hr\u00E1t trumf, pokud ho m\u00E1\u0161. Trumf p\u0159eb\u00EDj\u00ED ostatn\u00ED barvy. Na za\u010D\u00E1tku je\u0161t\u011B nen\u00ED ur\u010Den\u00FD, objev\u00ED se a\u017E prvn\u00ED hl\u00E1\u0161kou. Bez po\u017Eadovan\u00E9 barvy i bez trumfu sm\u00ED\u0161 hr\u00E1t cokoli.",
              "Zdvih vyhr\u00E1v\u00E1 nejvy\u0161\u0161\u00ED trumf, jinak nejvy\u0161\u0161\u00ED karta vynesen\u00E9 barvy. V\u00EDt\u011Bz z\u00EDsk\u00E1 body ze t\u0159\u00ED karet a vyn\u00E1\u0161\u00ED dal\u0161\u00ED. Pokra\u010Dujete do vypr\u00E1zdn\u011Bn\u00ED rukou.",
              "Karty aktu\u00E1ln\u00EDho zdvihu p\u0159e\u010Dte C, trumfovou barvu p\u0159ipomene F."),
            rule_section(:marriages, "Hl\u00E1\u0161ky",
              "Kr\u00E1l s d\u00E1mou stejn\u00E9 barvy umo\u017E\u0148uj\u00ED hl\u00E1\u0161ku, pokud jednou z t\u011Bchto karet vyn\u00E1\u0161\u00ED\u0161 nov\u00FD zdvih. Nesm\u00ED to b\u00FDt prvn\u00ED zdvih rozd\u00E1n\u00ED ani p\u0159ikl\u00E1d\u00E1n\u00ED po jin\u00E9m hr\u00E1\u010Di. Vyber kr\u00E1le nebo d\u00E1mu a stiskni Shift+Enter: karta se zahraje spolu s hl\u00E1\u0161kou.",
              "Ohl\u00E1\u0161en\u00ED okam\u017Eit\u011B p\u0159id\u00E1 body a ur\u010D\u00ED novou trumfovou barvu. Ka\u017Ed\u00E1 dal\u0161\u00ED hl\u00E1\u0161ka dosavadn\u00ED trumf nahrad\u00ED:",
              "- Srdcov\u00E1 hl\u00E1\u0161ka d\u00E1v\u00E1 100 bod\u016F.",
              "- K\u00E1rov\u00E1 80 bod\u016F.",
              "- K\u0159\u00ED\u017Eov\u00E1 60 bod\u016F.",
              "- Pikov\u00E1 40 bod\u016F.",
              "Kr\u00E1l \u010Di d\u00E1ma se daj\u00ED zahr\u00E1t i bez hl\u00E1\u0161ky. Pou\u017Eij Enter a vyber b\u011B\u017En\u00E9 zahr\u00E1n\u00ED. Jakmile dvojici rozd\u011Bl\u00ED\u0161, u\u017E ji ohl\u00E1sit nem\u016F\u017Ee\u0161."),
            rule_section(:scoring, "Vyhodnocen\u00ED rozd\u00E1n\u00ED",
              "Po posledn\u00EDm zdvihu se se\u010Dtou body z karet a hl\u00E1\u0161ek. Do celkov\u00E9ho sk\u00F3re se zap\u00ED\u0161\u00ED takto:",
              "- V\u00EDt\u011Bz licitace p\u0159i spln\u011Bn\u00ED z\u00EDsk\u00E1 pr\u00E1v\u011B hodnotu z\u00E1vazku. Se slibem 150 a skute\u010Dn\u00FDmi 170 body si p\u0159ip\u00ED\u0161e 150.",
              "- Nespln\u011Bn\u00FD z\u00E1vazek se cel\u00FD ode\u010Dte. P\u0159i slibu 150 a v\u00FDsledku 149 tedy ztrat\u00ED\u0161 150 bod\u016F.",
              "- Ostatn\u00ED si p\u0159ip\u00ED\u0161\u00ED z\u00EDskan\u00E9 body zaokrouhlen\u00E9 na nejbli\u017E\u0161\u00ED n\u00E1sobek p\u011Bti. V\u00FDsledek 42 se zap\u00ED\u0161e jako 40, 43 jako 45.",
              "Ka\u017Ed\u00E1 t\u0159i rozd\u00E1n\u00ED bez z\u00EDskan\u00E9ho bodu znamenaj\u00ED nav\u00EDc minus 120. Nemus\u00ED j\u00EDt za sebou. Sk\u00F3re p\u0159e\u010Dte S, po\u010Det nulov\u00FDch a vzdan\u00FDch rozd\u00E1n\u00ED Shift+S."),
            rule_section(:surrender, "Vzd\u00E1n\u00ED rozd\u00E1n\u00ED",
              "Po prohl\u00E9dnut\u00ED tal\u00F3nu sm\u00ED v\u00EDt\u011Bz licitace rozd\u00E1n\u00ED vzd\u00E1t, ale je\u0161t\u011B p\u0159ed p\u0159ed\u00E1n\u00EDm prvn\u00ED karty soupe\u0159i. Tabem najdi tla\u010D\u00EDtko vzd\u00E1n\u00ED rozd\u00E1n\u00ED a potvr\u010F Enterem.",
              "Za vzd\u00E1n\u00ED se z\u00E1vazek neode\u010D\u00EDt\u00E1. Ka\u017Ed\u00FD soupe\u0159 dostane polovinu jeho hodnoty, nejm\u00E9n\u011B v\u0161ak 60 bod\u016F, se zaokrouhlen\u00EDm nahoru na n\u00E1sobek p\u011Bti. Ka\u017Ed\u00E9 t\u0159et\u00ED vlastn\u00ED vzd\u00E1n\u00ED stoj\u00ED 120 bod\u016F."),
            rule_section(:ending, "Sud a v\u00EDt\u011Bzstv\u00ED",
              "Dos\u00E1hne\u0161-li po vyhodnocen\u00ED alespo\u0148 880, ale m\u00E9n\u011B ne\u017E 1000, sk\u00F3re se zastav\u00ED na 880. Jsi na takzvan\u00E9m sudu. M\u00E1\u0161 n\u00E1sleduj\u00EDc\u00ED t\u0159i odehran\u00E1 rozd\u00E1n\u00ED, abys vyhr\u00E1l licitaci a z\u00EDskal zb\u00FDvaj\u00EDc\u00ED body.",
              "Ze sudu vyhraje\u0161 spln\u011Bn\u00EDm vlastn\u00EDho z\u00E1vazku alespo\u0148 120. Men\u0161\u00ED z\u00E1vazek ani body z ciz\u00EDho v\u00EDt\u011Bzstv\u00ED v licitaci tv\u00E9 sk\u00F3re nezvednou. Nulov\u00E1 rozd\u00E1n\u00ED na sudu se nepo\u010D\u00EDtaj\u00ED do trestu za t\u0159i nuly.",
              "Vlastn\u00ED nespln\u011Bn\u00FD z\u00E1vazek se ode\u010Dte a sud ihned opust\u00ED\u0161. Nevyhraje\u0161-li ani b\u011Bhem t\u0159\u00ED odehran\u00FDch rozd\u00E1n\u00ED, ztrat\u00ED\u0161 120 a rovn\u011B\u017E ze sudu spadne\u0161. Zb\u00FDvaj\u00EDc\u00ED pokusy zjist\u00ED\u0161 pomoc\u00ED Shift+S.",
              "Na sudu nesm\u00ED\u0161 rozd\u00E1n\u00ED vzd\u00E1t. Za ciz\u00ED vzd\u00E1n\u00ED tak\u00E9 nedostane\u0161 body, ale takov\u00E9 rozd\u00E1n\u00ED ti ani nespot\u0159ebuje pokus.",
              "Hra kon\u010D\u00ED dosa\u017Een\u00EDm alespo\u0148 1000 bod\u016F. Siln\u00FDm z\u00E1vazkem lze vyhr\u00E1t i bez p\u0159edchoz\u00EDho sudu. Pokud hranici v jednom vyhodnocen\u00ED p\u0159ekro\u010D\u00ED v\u00EDce hr\u00E1\u010D\u016F, rozhoduje nejvy\u0161\u0161\u00ED sk\u00F3re."),
            rule_section(:variants, "Po\u010Det hr\u00E1\u010D\u016F a dal\u0161\u00ED nastaven\u00ED",
              "P\u0159ed hrou se v nastaven\u00ED stolu vyb\u00EDr\u00E1 varianta. Z\u00E1klad pro t\u0159i byl pops\u00E1n v\u00FD\u0161e; dal\u0161\u00ED m\u011Bn\u00ED rozd\u00E1n\u00ED takto:",
              "- Ve dvou jsou dva tal\u00F3ny, b\u011B\u017En\u011B po t\u0159ech kart\u00E1ch, a ka\u017Ed\u00FD dostane dev\u011Bt. V\u00EDt\u011Bz licitace vybere tal\u00F3n \u0161ipkami a Enterem naslepo. Potom jeho obsah uvid\u00ED oba. V\u00EDt\u011Bz odlo\u017E\u00ED t\u0159i vlastn\u00ED karty postupn\u011B \u0161ipkami a Enterem; soupe\u0159i je nep\u0159ed\u00E1v\u00E1. P\u0159ed prvn\u00EDm odlo\u017Een\u00EDm sm\u00ED rozd\u00E1n\u00ED vzd\u00E1t.",
              "- Ve \u010Dty\u0159ech rozd\u00E1vaj\u00EDc\u00ED odpo\u010D\u00EDv\u00E1 a ostatn\u00ED t\u0159i hraj\u00ED b\u011B\u017En\u00E9 rozd\u00E1n\u00ED. Odpo\u010D\u00EDvaj\u00EDc\u00ED neboduje a neutr\u00E1c\u00ED pokus na sudu. V dal\u0161\u00EDm rozd\u00E1n\u00ED odpo\u010D\u00EDv\u00E1 n\u00E1sleduj\u00EDc\u00ED hr\u00E1\u010D.",
              "- T\u00FDmov\u00E1 hra rozd\u011Bluje \u010Dty\u0159i hr\u00E1\u010De do dvou dvojic se spole\u010Dn\u00FDmi body.",
              "Ve dvou lze zvolit tal\u00F3ny po dvou kart\u00E1ch. Ka\u017Ed\u00FD pak za\u010D\u00EDn\u00E1 s deseti a v\u00EDt\u011Bz po p\u0159evzet\u00ED tal\u00F3nu odlo\u017E\u00ED dv\u011B.",
              "B\u011B\u017En\u011B ve dvou z\u00EDsk\u00E1 v\u00EDt\u011Bz posledn\u00EDho zdvihu i body z nevybran\u00E9ho tal\u00F3nu a odlo\u017Een\u00FDch karet. Tuto volbu lze vypnout; pak je nez\u00EDsk\u00E1 nikdo.",
              "Zm\u011Bnit lze tak\u00E9 bodov\u00FD c\u00EDl. Sud je v\u017Edy 120 bod\u016F p\u0159ed n\u00EDm, ostatn\u00ED jeho podm\u00EDnky se nem\u011Bn\u00ED."),
            rule_section(:teams, "Hra dvojic",
              "S partnerem pln\u00EDte z\u00E1vazek spole\u010Dn\u011B. Vyhraje\u0161-li licitaci na 150, k jeho spln\u011Bn\u00ED se s\u010D\u00EDtaj\u00ED tvoje i partnerovy z\u00EDskan\u00E9 body.",
              "Ka\u017Ed\u00FD dostane p\u011Bt karet a tal\u00F3n m\u00E1 \u010Dty\u0159i. V\u00EDt\u011Bz licitace ho vezme a odevzd\u00E1 po jedn\u00E9 kart\u011B ka\u017Ed\u00E9mu ze zb\u00FDvaj\u00EDc\u00EDch t\u0159\u00ED hr\u00E1\u010D\u016F, tedy i partnerovi.",
              "Spole\u010Dn\u011B po\u010D\u00EDt\u00E1te karty i hl\u00E1\u0161ky. Ka\u017Ed\u00FD v\u0161ak hraje vlastn\u00ED rukou podle b\u011B\u017En\u00FDch povinnost\u00ED: p\u0159iznat barvu, bez n\u00ED trumfovat. Plat\u00ED to, i kdy\u017E ve zdvihu pr\u00E1v\u011B vede partner.",
              "Dvojice m\u00E1 spole\u010Dn\u00E9 sk\u00F3re, spole\u010Dn\u011B vstupuje na sud a sd\u00EDl\u00ED jeho pokusy i po\u010Dty nul a vzd\u00E1n\u00ED. B\u011B\u017En\u00E9 bodov\u00E1n\u00ED se tak vztahuje na cel\u00FD t\u00FDm."),
            rule_section(:controls, "Kl\u00E1vesov\u00E9 zkratky",
              "\u0160ipky: vybrat nab\u00EDdku nebo kartu k p\u0159ed\u00E1n\u00ED \u010Di zahr\u00E1n\u00ED.",
              "Enter: potvrdit volbu; na kart\u011B ji zahr\u00E1t nebo vybrat hl\u00E1\u0161ku.",
              "Shift+Enter: okam\u017Eit\u011B ohl\u00E1sit dostupnou hl\u00E1\u0161ku; bez n\u00ED se karta nezahraje.",
              "B: po v\u00FDm\u011Bn\u011B p\u0159ed prvn\u00ED kartou zm\u011Bnit z\u00E1vazek, jinak p\u0159e\u010D\u00EDst nab\u00EDdky.",
              "H: p\u0159e\u010D\u00EDst vlastn\u00ED ruku.",
              "C: p\u0159e\u010D\u00EDst karty ve zdvihu.",
              "Ctrl+C: prohl\u00E9dnout karty ve zdvihu.",
              "F: p\u0159e\u010D\u00EDst trumfovou barvu.",
              "S: p\u0159e\u010D\u00EDst sk\u00F3re a stav sudu.",
              "Shift+S: p\u0159e\u010D\u00EDst nuly, vzd\u00E1n\u00ED a pokusy na sudu.",
              "Z: naj\u00EDt dal\u0161\u00ED p\u0159\u00EDpustnou kartu; mo\u017Enost hl\u00E1\u0161ky br\u00E1n\u00ED automatick\u00E9mu zahr\u00E1n\u00ED.",
              "Shift+Z: naj\u00EDt p\u0159edchoz\u00ED p\u0159\u00EDpustnou kartu; mo\u017Enost hl\u00E1\u0161ky br\u00E1n\u00ED automatick\u00E9mu zahr\u00E1n\u00ED.",
              "T: ozn\u00E1mit, kdo je na tahu.",
              "Shift+C: se\u0159adit podle barev; opakov\u00E1n\u00EDm obr\u00E1tit po\u0159ad\u00ED.",
              "Shift+H: se\u0159adit podle hodnot; opakov\u00E1n\u00EDm obr\u00E1tit po\u0159ad\u00ED.",
              "Shift+M: obnovit po\u0159ad\u00ED p\u0159ijat\u00FDch karet.")
          ]
        when "en"
          [
            rule_section(:aim, "Aim of the game",
              "In Tysi\u0105c, you score points by winning cards and announcing a king and queen of the same suit. After the deal, players bid for the right to take extra cards. The highest bidder promises to score at least the amount they bid. The others try to stop them while earning points of their own. Reach 1,000 points to win.",
              "The standard game is for three players, with seven cards each. Three extra cards, called the talon, go to the winner of the bidding. The deck contains only nines, tens, jacks, queens, kings and aces."),
            rule_section(:cards, "Card strength and points",
              "After the bidding, each player plays one card in turn. These three cards form a trick, which one player wins and collects. Their values count towards that player's points for the deal.",
              "From strongest to weakest, the cards are ace, ten, king, queen, jack and nine. They are worth:",
              "- Ace: 11 points.",
              "- Ten: 10 points.",
              "- King: 4 points.",
              "- Queen: 3 points.",
              "- Jack: 2 points.",
              "- Nine: no points.",
              "Together, the cards are worth 120 points. You can score more by announcing a marriage: a king and queen of the same suit. The Marriages section explains when and how to do this."),
            rule_section(:auction, "Bidding",
              "Browse your hand with the arrow keys or press H to hear it. The player after the dealer makes the first bid, which must be at least 100. Each later bid must be at least 5 higher, and all bids must be multiples of five.",
              "On your bidding turn, press Enter on any card to open the bids. Choose an amount you believe you can score, or pass, with the arrows and confirm with Enter. Passing withdraws you from this auction. The opening player must make a bid first.",
              "Without a marriage in your hand, your highest bid is 120. Each marriage raises that ceiling by its value, up to an absolute maximum of 400. The list offers only bids your cards allow.",
              "When everyone else has passed, the last bidder wins. Their final bid becomes their contract: the number of points they must score in this deal. Press B to hear the bids."),
            rule_section(:talon, "The talon and your contract",
              "The highest bidder receives the talon, whose cards are revealed to everyone. They then give one card to each opponent. If you won the bidding, select a card for the named player with the arrows and press Enter, then do the same for the other player. Everyone now has eight cards.",
              "You may keep your contract or raise it. Press B, choose the new amount and confirm with Enter. Your remaining marriages determine how high you can go, but you cannot lower the bid you already made.",
              "The highest bidder leads the first card. If you are keeping your contract, just select a card and press Enter. Playing that first card ends your chance to raise the contract."),
            rule_section(:play, "Playing the cards",
              "On your turn, select a card with the arrows and play it with Enter. If someone has already led a card, you must follow its suit if you can. For example, when diamonds are led, you must play a diamond if you have one. You do not have to beat a higher card already played.",
              "If you cannot follow suit, you must play a trump if you have one. Trump is a suit that beats all the others. There is no trump at the start of a deal; announcing a marriage establishes it. If you have neither the led suit nor a trump, play any card.",
              "The highest trump wins the trick. If no trump was played, the highest card of the led suit wins. The winner scores the value of the three cards and leads the next trick. Continue until all hands are empty.",
              "Press C to hear the current trick and F to check the trump suit."),
            rule_section(:marriages, "Marriages",
              "To announce a marriage, you need both the king and queen of one suit and must lead one of them to a new trick. You cannot announce in the first trick of a deal or when following someone else's lead. Select the king or queen and press Shift+Enter to play it and announce the marriage together.",
              "The marriage immediately earns points and makes its suit trump. A later marriage replaces the previous trump suit. The values are:",
              "- Hearts: 100 points.",
              "- Diamonds: 80 points.",
              "- Clubs: 60 points.",
              "- Spades: 40 points.",
              "You can play the king or queen without announcing. Press Enter and choose the ordinary play instead. Once you have separated the pair, you can no longer announce that marriage."),
            rule_section(:scoring, "Scoring a deal",
              "After the last trick, add the points from captured cards and announced marriages. They affect your overall score as follows:",
              "- If the highest bidder meets or exceeds their contract, they add the contract amount. A contract of 150 with 170 points collected still earns 150.",
              "- If they fall short, they lose the contract amount. Scoring 149 against a contract of 150 therefore costs 150 points.",
              "- Everyone else adds the points they collected, rounded to the nearest five. A total of 42 rounds to 40; 43 rounds to 45.",
              "Every third deal in which you collect no points costs another 120 points. These deals do not have to be consecutive. Press S for scores or Shift+S to check the counts of scoreless and surrendered deals."),
            rule_section(:surrender, "Surrendering a deal",
              "After seeing the talon, the highest bidder may surrender instead of playing the deal. Decide before giving away the first card. Tab to Surrender deal and press Enter.",
              "Surrendering does not subtract your contract. Each opponent receives half its value, with a minimum of 60 points, rounded up to the next multiple of five. Every third time you surrender costs you 120 points."),
            rule_section(:ending, "The barrel and winning",
              "If a deal brings your score to at least 880 but below 1,000, it is set to 880. This is called being on the barrel. You have the next three played deals to win the bidding and score the points you need.",
              "While on the barrel, you can win only by fulfilling your own contract of at least 120. Smaller contracts and points earned when someone else won the bidding do not increase your score. Scoreless deals on the barrel do not count towards the penalty for three zeroes.",
              "If you fail your own contract, you lose its value and leave the barrel immediately. If your three chances run out without a win, you lose 120 points and leave it. Shift+S tells you how many chances remain.",
              "A player on the barrel cannot surrender. They receive no points when someone else surrenders, and that deal does not use up one of their chances.",
              "The game ends when someone reaches at least 1,000 points. A large enough contract can take you straight to a win without going onto the barrel. If several players cross the target in the same deal, the highest score wins."),
            rule_section(:variants, "Player counts and variants",
              "Choose the player count and variant in the table settings. Three-player Tysi\u0105c follows the rules above. The other versions change the deal:",
              "- Two players: there are two talons, normally with three cards each, and each player starts with nine cards. The highest bidder chooses a talon with the arrows and Enter without seeing its contents. Its cards are then revealed to both players. The bidder discards three cards, selecting each with the arrows and Enter, rather than giving cards to the opponent. They may surrender before discarding the first card.",
              "- Four players: the dealer sits out while the other three play a normal deal. The dealer scores nothing and does not use a chance on the barrel. A different player sits out next time.",
              "- Teams: two pairs play together, sharing their points.",
              "In the two-player version, you can choose two-card talons instead. Players then start with ten cards each, and the bidder discards two after taking a talon.",
              "By default, the winner of the last trick in a two-player deal also gets the points from the unused talon and the bidder's discards. You can turn this off, in which case nobody scores those cards.",
              "You can change the winning score. The barrel always starts 120 points below that target; its other rules stay the same."),
            rule_section(:teams, "Team play",
              "Partners work together to fulfil the contract. If you bid 150, your points and your partner's are added together: between you, you need at least 150.",
              "Each player receives five cards and the talon holds four. The highest bidder takes it, then gives one card to each of the other three players, including their partner.",
              "Your team shares points from cards and marriages, but you still follow the usual rules when playing. Follow suit if you can; otherwise, play a trump if you have one. This applies even when your partner is already winning the trick.",
              "The pair has one score and goes onto the barrel together. Chances on the barrel, scoreless deals and surrenders are counted for the whole team. Scoring follows the individual rules, applied to the pair."),
            rule_section(:controls, "Keyboard shortcuts",
              "Arrow keys: choose a bid or a card to give away or play.",
              "Enter: confirm your choice; play a card or choose to announce a marriage.",
              "Shift+Enter: announce an available marriage immediately; do not play if none is available.",
              "B: after exchanging cards and before the opening lead, change your contract; otherwise, read the bids.",
              "H: read your hand.",
              "C: read the current trick.",
              "Ctrl+C: browse the cards in the trick.",
              "F: read the trump suit.",
              "S: read scores and who is on the barrel.",
              "Shift+S: read scoreless deals, surrenders and remaining barrel chances.",
              "Z: find the next legal card; automatic play is disabled when a marriage can be announced.",
              "Shift+Z: find the previous legal card; automatic play is disabled when a marriage can be announced.",
              "T: announce whose turn it is.",
              "Shift+C: sort by suit; press again to reverse.",
              "Shift+H: sort by rank; press again to reverse.",
              "Shift+M: restore the order in which you received the cards.")
          ]
        when "es"
          [
            rule_section(:aim, "Objetivo",
              "En Mil ganas puntos por las cartas que captures y por anunciar parejas de rey y reina. Primero se subasta qui\u00E9n se compromete a reunir m\u00E1s puntos. El ganador debe cumplir su promesa; los dem\u00E1s intentan impedirlo y puntuar por su cuenta. La meta es alcanzar 1000 puntos.",
              "La partida habitual es para tres personas. Cada una recibe siete cartas y el ganador de la subasta recoge tres m\u00E1s de una reserva. La baraja va del nueve al as."),
            rule_section(:cards, "Fuerza y puntos de las cartas",
              "Despu\u00E9s de la subasta se juega por turnos una carta por persona. Las tres forman una baza, que recoge un jugador y le da los puntos de sus cartas.",
              "De mayor a menor fuerza van as, diez, rey, reina, jota y nueve. Sus puntos son:",
              "- As: 11.",
              "- Diez: 10.",
              "- Rey: 4.",
              "- Reina: 3.",
              "- Jota: 2.",
              "- Nueve: 0.",
              "Todas las cartas juntas valen 120 puntos. Puedes sumar m\u00E1s anunciando un matrimonio, la pareja de rey y reina del mismo palo. El apartado \u00ABMatrimonios\u00BB explica c\u00F3mo hacerlo."),
            rule_section(:auction, "La subasta",
              "Revisa tu mano con las flechas o con H. Empieza quien sigue al repartidor. La primera oferta debe ser al menos 100; cada nueva oferta supera la anterior en al menos 5. Todas deben ser m\u00FAltiplos de cinco.",
              "Cuando te toque, pulsa Enter sobre cualquier carta para abrir la lista de ofertas. Elige cu\u00E1ntos puntos prometes reunir o elige pasar y confirma con Enter. Pasar te retira de esa subasta. Quien la abre debe hacer una oferta antes de poder pasar.",
              "Sin matrimonios en la mano no puedes superar 120. Cada matrimonio aumenta ese m\u00E1ximo en su valor, pero ninguna oferta puede superar 400. La lista solo muestra lo permitido por tus cartas.",
              "Cuando todos menos uno pasan, la \u00FAltima oferta del ganador se convierte en su contrato: los puntos que debe reunir en la mano. B consulta las ofertas actuales."),
            rule_section(:talon, "Reserva y contrato definitivo",
              "El ganador recibe la reserva y todos conocen su contenido. Despu\u00E9s entrega una carta a cada rival. Si has ganado t\u00FA, elige con las flechas una carta para la persona indicada y pulsa Enter; repite para la otra. Todos terminan con ocho cartas.",
              "Ahora puedes mantener o aumentar el contrato. Pulsa B, elige la cantidad y confirma. El nuevo m\u00E1ximo depende de los matrimonios que conserves, pero nunca puedes rebajar lo que ya prometiste.",
              "El ganador abre la primera baza. Si no quieres cambiar el contrato, selecciona una carta y ju\u00E9gala con Enter. Esa primera carta cierra definitivamente la posibilidad de aumentar el contrato."),
            rule_section(:play, "Jugar las bazas",
              "Selecciona tu carta con las flechas y pulsa Enter. Debes seguir el palo de la primera carta si tienes alguno. Si se sali\u00F3 con diamantes, juegas diamantes. No est\u00E1s obligado a superar una carta m\u00E1s alta del rival.",
              "Si no tienes el palo de salida, debes jugar triunfo si tienes. El triunfo vence a los otros palos; al empezar no hay ninguno y se establece al anunciar un matrimonio. Si tampoco tienes triunfo, puedes jugar cualquier carta.",
              "Gana el triunfo m\u00E1s alto o, si no hay triunfos, la carta m\u00E1s alta del palo de salida. Su due\u00F1o recoge los puntos de las tres cartas y abre la siguiente baza. Se contin\u00FAa hasta agotar las manos.",
              "C lee la baza actual y F recuerda el triunfo."),
            rule_section(:marriages, "Matrimonios",
              "Si tienes rey y reina del mismo palo, puedes anunciar el matrimonio al abrir una baza con una de esas cartas. No se permite en la primera baza de la mano ni al jugar despu\u00E9s de otro. Selecciona el rey o la reina y pulsa Shift+Enter: juegas la carta y anuncias a la vez.",
              "El anuncio da puntos inmediatamente y convierte ese palo en triunfo. Cada matrimonio posterior sustituye el triunfo anterior:",
              "- Corazones: 100 puntos.",
              "- Diamantes: 80 puntos.",
              "- Tr\u00E9boles: 60 puntos.",
              "- Picas: 40 puntos.",
              "Tambi\u00E9n puedes jugar el rey o la reina sin anunciar. Usa Enter y elige la jugada normal de la lista. Una vez separada la pareja ya no podr\u00E1s anunciar ese matrimonio."),
            rule_section(:scoring, "Recuento de la mano",
              "Al terminar se suman cartas capturadas y matrimonios anunciados. La puntuaci\u00F3n de la partida cambia as\u00ED:",
              "- Si el ganador de la subasta cumple, a\u00F1ade el contrato, no los puntos sobrantes. Con contrato de 150 y 170 reunidos, suma 150.",
              "- Si no cumple, resta el contrato completo. Prometer 150 y reunir 149 cuesta 150 puntos.",
              "- Los dem\u00E1s a\u00F1aden lo reunido, redondeado al m\u00FAltiplo de cinco m\u00E1s pr\u00F3ximo. As\u00ED, 42 se anota como 40 y 43 como 45.",
              "Cada tres manos sin ganar ning\u00FAn punto restan otros 120. No tienen que ser consecutivas. S consulta los resultados y Shift+S los contadores de manos sin puntos y manos abandonadas."),
            rule_section(:surrender, "Abandonar una mano",
              "Despu\u00E9s de ver la reserva, el ganador puede renunciar a jugar esa mano. Debe hacerlo antes de entregar la primera carta. Llega con Tab al bot\u00F3n para abandonar la mano y pulsa Enter.",
              "Abandonar no resta el contrato. Cada rival recibe la mitad de su valor, con un m\u00EDnimo de 60, redondeada hacia arriba a m\u00FAltiplo de cinco. Cada tercer abandono tuyo te cuesta 120 puntos."),
            rule_section(:ending, "El barril y la victoria",
              "Si despu\u00E9s del recuento alcanzas al menos 880 pero menos de 1000, tu resultado se fija en 880. Est\u00E1s en el barril: tienes las tres siguientes manos jugadas para ganar una subasta y conseguir los puntos que faltan.",
              "Para ganar desde el barril necesitas cumplir un contrato propio de al menos 120. Un contrato menor o los puntos de una mano cuya subasta gan\u00F3 otro no aumentan tu resultado. Las manos sin puntos mientras est\u00E1s en el barril no cuentan para la penalizaci\u00F3n de tres ceros.",
              "Incumplir tu contrato resta su valor y te hace salir del barril inmediatamente. Si pasan tres manos jugadas sin que ganes, pierdes 120 y tambi\u00E9n sales. Shift+S indica cu\u00E1ntas oportunidades quedan.",
              "Quien est\u00E1 en el barril no puede abandonar una mano. Tampoco recibe puntos cuando otro abandona, y esa mano no consume una oportunidad.",
              "La partida termina al alcanzar alguien al menos 1000. Tambi\u00E9n puedes hacerlo con un contrato alto antes de entrar en el barril. Si varios cruzan la meta en el mismo recuento, gana quien tenga m\u00E1s puntos."),
            rule_section(:variants, "Otros n\u00FAmeros de jugadores",
              "Antes de empezar se elige la modalidad. La de tres personas usa las reglas anteriores; las dem\u00E1s cambian el reparto as\u00ED:",
              "- Dos jugadores: hay dos reservas, normalmente de tres cartas, y cada persona recibe nueve. El ganador de la subasta elige una reserva con las flechas y Enter sin conocer su contenido; despu\u00E9s ambos la conocen. Aparta tres cartas de su mano, una a una con las flechas y Enter, sin entregarlas al rival. Puede abandonar antes de apartar la primera.",
              "- Cuatro jugadores: el repartidor descansa y los otros tres juegan una mano normal. Quien descansa no gana puntos ni consume oportunidades del barril. En la siguiente mano descansa otra persona.",
              "- Equipos: dos parejas comparten puntuaci\u00F3n.",
              "Con dos jugadores puedes elegir reservas de dos cartas. Cada uno empieza con diez y el ganador aparta dos tras recoger la reserva elegida.",
              "Por defecto, en el juego de dos personas el ganador de la \u00FAltima baza recibe los puntos de la reserva no elegida y las cartas apartadas. Puedes desactivarlo; entonces esos puntos no los recibe nadie.",
              "Tambi\u00E9n puedes cambiar la meta. El barril siempre empieza 120 puntos antes de ella; sus dem\u00E1s reglas se mantienen."),
            rule_section(:teams, "Juego por parejas",
              "Los compa\u00F1eros re\u00FAnen puntos para cumplir juntos el contrato. Si ganas la subasta con 150, se suman tus puntos y los de tu compa\u00F1ero: entre ambos necesit\u00E1is al menos 150.",
              "Cada uno recibe cinco cartas y la reserva tiene cuatro. El ganador la recoge y entrega una carta a cada una de las otras tres personas, incluido su compa\u00F1ero.",
              "Se suman las cartas capturadas y los matrimonios de ambos. Sigues jugando tu propia mano y respetando el palo de salida o, si no lo tienes, el triunfo cuando sea posible. Esto tambi\u00E9n se exige cuando tu compa\u00F1ero ya est\u00E1 ganando la baza.",
              "La pareja comparte resultado, barril, oportunidades y contadores de ceros y abandonos. El recuento es el mismo que en individual, aplicado a toda la pareja."),
            rule_section(:controls, "Teclas de referencia",
              "Flechas: elegir oferta, carta para entregar o carta para jugar.",
              "Enter: confirmar; sobre una carta, jugarla o elegir anunciar un matrimonio.",
              "Shift+Enter: anunciar directamente un matrimonio disponible; si no lo hay, no jugar la carta.",
              "B: cambiar el contrato tras el reparto adicional y antes de la primera carta; en otros momentos, consultar ofertas.",
              "H: leer tu mano.",
              "C: leer la baza.",
              "Ctrl+C: recorrer las cartas de la baza.",
              "F: consultar el triunfo.",
              "S: consultar resultados y barril.",
              "Shift+S: consultar ceros, abandonos y oportunidades del barril.",
